{"ref":"powerup:defang","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Defang.png","w":128,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Defang is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It renders certain enemies unable to harm the player."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["19 October 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["DEFANG"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+3%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+15%"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 10"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Defang turns a percentage of enemies from each spawn interval unable to deal damage to the player. Enemies affected by Defang are visually identified by a green appearance, which the player can disable in the settings."]},{"k":"p","c":["Some enemies cannot be Defanged. This includes, but is not limited to: wave bosses, enemies from wave events, and special enemies such as Atlanteans."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Defang PowerUp increases the quantity of enemies unable to deal damage by 3% per rank, with a maximum rank of 5. At rank 5, 15% of enemies are defanged. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 10, and is unlocked by collecting ",{"i":"Sprite-Antidote.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:antidote"}," ",{"t":"Antidote","r":"relic:antidote"}," in ",{"t":"Whiteout","r":"stage:whiteout"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Defang"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+3%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+6%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+9%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+12%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["+15%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The weapons ",{"i":"Sprite-Time_Warp.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:time-warp"}," ",{"t":"Time Warp","r":"weapon:time-warp"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Gaze_of_Gaea.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:gaze-of-gaea"}," ",{"t":"Gaze of Gaea","r":"weapon:gaze-of-gaea"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Embrace_of_Gaea.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:embrace-of-gaea"}," ",{"t":"Embrace of Gaea","r":"weapon:embrace-of-gaea"}," have a chance to Defang enemies. The chance of it happening is affected by ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-characters","title":"From characters","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"from-characters-ode-to-castlevania","title":"Ode to Castlevania","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Astarte.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:astarte"}," ",{"t":"Astarte","r":"character:astarte"}," starts with +15% Defang."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 19 October 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Defang, ",{"i":"Sprite-Charm.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:charm"}," ",{"t":"Charm","r":"powerup:charm"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Fever.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:fever"}," ",{"t":"Fever","r":"powerup:fever"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Preserve.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:preserve"}," ",{"t":"Preserve","r":"powerup:preserve"},", Invulnerability Time, and Thorns are the only character stats in the game that are not displayed on the stat panel."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}